---
// MedicalDisclaimer.astro
// Site-wide medical disclaimer for footer
---

<div class="border-t border-emerald-900/10 pt-6 mt-6 space-y-3">
  <p class="text-xs text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
    <span class="font-semibold text-emerald-950">Disclaimer:</span> The information on this website is for educational purposes and does not constitute medical advice. Naturopathic care complements but does not replace conventional medical care.
  </p>
  <p class="text-xs">
    <strong class="text-red-700">For medical emergencies, call 911 immediately.</strong>
  </p>
  <!-- Standalone links, so they carry a 24px minimum target (WCAG 2.2 2.5.8)
       without enlarging the type. The negative inline margin keeps the row
       optically flush with the disclaimer text above. -->
  <p class="-mx-2 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-1 gap-y-1 text-xs">
    <a href="/privacy/" class="inline-flex min-h-6 items-center rounded px-2 py-1 text-emerald-700 underline underline-offset-2 transition-colors hover:text-emerald-900 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-emerald-500">Privacy Policy</a>
    <a href="/editorial-policy/" class="inline-flex min-h-6 items-center rounded px-2 py-1 text-emerald-700 underline underline-offset-2 transition-colors hover:text-emerald-900 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-emerald-500">Editorial Policy</a>
  </p>
</div>
